BS_:

BU_: STM32 PC

BO_ 1280 BNO085_Data: 20 STM32
 SG_ Timestamp_Ms : 0|32@1+ (1,0) [0|4294967295] "ms" PC
 SG_ Seq : 32|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" PC
 SG_ Status : 40|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" PC
 SG_ Accel_X : 48|16@1- (0.001,0) [-32.768|32.767] "m/s^2" PC
 SG_ Accel_Y : 64|16@1- (0.001,0) [-32.768|32.767] "m/s^2" PC
 SG_ Accel_Z : 80|16@1- (0.001,0) [-32.768|32.767] "m/s^2" PC
